          <div class="day"><div class="top"><div class="num">DAY<small>1</small></div><div class="route">Kota Asal → KLIA → Kuala Lumpur</div></div>
            <ul><li>Tiba di KLIA, penyambutan peserta</li><li>City tour: KLCC &amp; ikon Kuala Lumpur</li><li>Check-in hotel &amp; istirahat</li></ul></div>
          <div class="day"><div class="top"><div class="num">DAY<small>2</small></div><div class="route">Kuala Lumpur — Kampus Malaysia</div></div>
            <ul><li>Kunjungan &amp; benchmarking ke Universitas Mitra Malaysia 1</li><li>Seminar internasional di Universitas Mitra Malaysia 2</li><li>Batu Caves / Putrajaya (city tour edukatif)</li></ul></div>
          <div class="day"><div class="top"><div class="num">DAY<small>3</small></div><div class="route">Kuala Lumpur → Thailand (lintas batas)</div></div>
            <ul><li>Perjalanan darat menuju Thailand Selatan (Hatyai)</li><li>Explore kota &amp; ASEAN night bazaar</li><li>Check-in hotel</li></ul></div>
          <div class="day"><div class="top"><div class="num">DAY<small>4</small></div><div class="route">Hatyai – Songkhla — Kampus Thailand</div></div>
            <ul><li>Kunjungan &amp; benchmarking ke Universitas Mitra Thailand</li><li>Pantai Samila &amp; Masjid Songkhla</li><li>Floating market / oleh-oleh</li></ul></div>
          <div class="day" style="grid-column:1/-1"><div class="top"><div class="num">DAY<small>5</small></div><div class="route">Thailand → KLIA → Kota Asal</div></div>
            <ul><li>Perjalanan kembali menuju KLIA</li><li>Kepulangan peserta ke kota asal masing-masing</li></ul></div>
        </div>
